			"notes": "GuildZip 1.6.0 — a full rewrite, leaner and more customizable.\n\nTwo builds — download the jar for your Minecraft version:\n- GuildZip-mc26.1-1.6.0.jar — Minecraft 26.1.x\n- GuildZip-mc26.2-1.6.0.jar — Minecraft 26.2\n\nChanges:\n- Modern config screen (bundled Resourceful Config) — /gz opens it directly, nothing else to install\n- Color pickers for every element (prefixes, alias, names, version labels)\n- English only\n- Rewritten in Kotlin — same behavior, much leaner codebase\n- Simplified update notice\n\nRequires Fabric API + Fabric Language Kotlin."
		},
