			"notes": "# GuildZip 1.5.0 — Minecraft 26.1\n\nGuildZip is now available for **Minecraft 26.1.x**! 🎉\n\n## ⚠️ Requirements changed\n- **Minecraft 26.1+** and **Java 25** (required by Minecraft 26.1)\n- Fabric Loader 0.18+ · Fabric API\n\n## What's new\n- ⬆️ **Full port to Minecraft 26.1** (migrated to the new unobfuscated codebase)\n- 🔔 **Auto-updater removed** — no more automatic jar downloads. Instead, you get a simple clickable chat message ~5 seconds after joining Hypixel when a new version is available. You can turn it off in the config (Advanced → Update Notifications).\n- 🛡️ Update check now only looks at versions published for *your* Minecraft version\n- 🗑️ Removed duplicate message compaction `(x2)` — Hypixel already blocks sending the same message twice\n- 🧹 `/gz dismiss` and `/gz noupdate` removed (no longer needed)\n\n## Still on Minecraft 1.21.x?\n**Do not install this version.** Stay on **GuildZip 1.4.8**, the final 1.21.x release."
		},
